            <a href="/" class="navbar-brand" style="font-size: 20px;">Cover<span>Score</span> AI</a>
            <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 8px;">Building the future of insurance risk intelligence</p>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <a href="/privacy" style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none;">Privacy</a>
            <a href="/terms" style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none;">Terms</a>
            <a href="/contact" style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none;">Contact</a>
